  "feature_docs": {
    "surrogate_pair": "From clauses build signed pairwise J_ij += s_i*s_j for every pair in a clause. Diagonal cost E_surr[z] = sum_{i<j} J_ij * z_i * z_j with z_k=1-2x_k. This is a 2-body Ising surrogate of 4-SAT \u2014 NOT the unsat count Hc=sum_c C_c, and not a monotone rescaling of Hc (see honesty stats).",
    "noncomm_xz": "Per cavity: U = exp(-i\u03b3 sum_j deg_j X_j) @ exp(-i\u03b3 sum_j bias_j Z_j), deg_j = clause incidence of bit j, bias_j = (#pos - #neg)/m. X and Z on the same bit do not commute \u2192 product \u2260 any densified Z-phase of Hc. No clause projectors.",
    "wrong_graph": "Fixed-per-n RNG perm \u03c0 of variable labels; rewrite each clause v\u2192\u03c0(v); cost = densified unsat of scrambled formula E_wrong; score with true E. Does not reconstruct true clauses unless shared SNAP+D magically inverts \u03c0 (ablation vs trunc_Hc)."
  },
